{"title":"2023 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>What is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/7/b/07b93c6f1cc616640c18c4745e9c502ab0627461.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{1} + \\frac{2}{2} + \\frac{3}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"86\" height=\"38\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/c/55c79fde2d50531ce944c3900917f14f8648c394.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{ (A) }\\ 1 \\qquad\\text{ (B) }\\ 0 \\qquad\\text{ (C) }\\ 3 \\qquad\\text{ (D) }\\ 9 \\qquad\\text{ (E) }\\ 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"397\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Using the greatest common denominator, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/f/0af063cc34bbe4daea72b5a9391f367274543f2f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1 \\times 6}{1 \\times 6} + \\frac{2 \\times 3}{2 \\times 3} + \\frac{3 \\times 2}{3 \\times 2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"179\" height=\"40\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/4/ed44495eef1d925f48d42ac7c14e5b3fc4686cfa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\frac{6}{6} + \\frac{6}{6} + \\frac{6}{6} = \\frac{18}{6} = \\boxed {\\textbf {(C) } 3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"231\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/9/d79c96e270e148516fb5dd4a73725d8be87c80c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x \\neq 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"46\" height=\"18\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/9/029a94f51013e12d3295f99b26946e90004d6614.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{x}{x} = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"50\" height=\"34\" />. Thus, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/7/c674c4bb60a01af1e22fe66bc0201105f83b3b2f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 + 1 + 1 = \\boxed {\\textbf {(C) } 3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"153\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can clearly see that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/5/ce5b0fc391f2ec087c5e4db42e48098c3a093b52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{1}=1, \\frac{2}{2}=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"103\" height=\"38\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/b/a1bc611c44f6b4eb960ba29d9cea4bbd606ba996.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{3}{3}=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"48\" height=\"38\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/d/a4d206441a6dd757e2cd4551c3caaba3c8847089.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1+1+1=3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"107\" height=\"15\" />.\n</p><p>Thus, the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/e/44eb511c4f725b6b8f6c6a941d77324031885652.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(C) } 3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"55\" height=\"28\" />\n</p><p>-LucasW\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CEMC_Cayley\" title=\"2023 CEMC Cayley\">2023 CEMC Cayley</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CEMC_Cayley_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2023 CEMC Cayley Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CEMC_Cayley_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2023 CEMC Cayley Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First Problem</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2023 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 2 (page does not exist)\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2023 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 2 (page does not exist)\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2023 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 3 (page does not exist)\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2023 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 4 (page does not exist)\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2023 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 5 (page does not exist)\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2023 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 6 (page does not exist)\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2023 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 7 (page does not exist)\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2023 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 8 (page do